<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Analysts International.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Analysts International.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Stephens Inc said Monday it downgraded Analysts International Corp to buy from strong buy based on price.</p>
<p>-- said the stock has risen 40 percent since April 21, surpassing Stephens' six month price target of $31 a share and approaching the long-term target of $36 a share.</p>
<p>-- said raised the 12-18 month price target to $42 a share.</p>
<p>-- Analysts International gained 1-1/8 to 35-1/4.</p>
</text>
